  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;CHRIS SUMMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chris Summers is an American ice hockey player who was drafted by the Arizona Coyotes in 2006 and later by the Cleveland Cavaliers in the NBA draft. He is known for his hard work and dedication to his craft."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARIZONA COYOTES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Arizona Coyotes are an ice hockey team in the National Hockey League (NHL) that drafted Chris Summers in 2006."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW YORK RANGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The New York Rangers are an ice hockey team in the NHL where Chris Summers also played."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLORIDA PANTHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Florida Panthers are an ice hockey team in the NHL where Chris Summers played."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL HOCKEY LEAGUE (NHL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Hockey League is the professional ice hockey league where Chris Summers played."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES NATIONAL TEAM DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM (USNTDP)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The USNTDP is a program that helped develop Chris Summers' skills before his NHL draft selection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLEVELAND CAVALIERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cleveland Cavaliers are a professional basketball team in the National Basketball Association (NBA) that drafted Chris Summers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIKE GARTNER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mike Gartner is a former NHL player and current President of the Arizona Coyotes Alumni Association."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK SEIDEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Seidel is the former Chief Amateur Scout of the Arizona Coyotes who selected Chris Summers in the 2006 NHL Entry Draft."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KOBY ALTMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Koby Altman is the General Manager of the Cleveland Cavaliers who drafted Chris Summers in the NBA draft."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK JACKSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Jackson is an NBA analyst who criticized the Cleveland Cavaliers' decision to draft Chris Summers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLENDALE, ARIZONA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GLENDALE, ARIZONA is the city where the Arizona Coyotes are based and where Chris Summers' draft selection was announced."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL BASKETBALL ASSOCIATION (NBA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Basketball Association is the professional basketball league where Chris Summers was drafted by the Cleveland Cavaliers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2006 NHL ENTRY DRAFT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 2006 NHL Entry Draft is the event where Chris Summers was selected by the Arizona Coyotes in the first round (29th overall)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2006 NBA DRAFT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 2006 NBA Draft is the event where Chris Summers was selected by the Cleveland Cavaliers in the second round (25th overall)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HARD WORK AND DEDICATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hard work and dedication are key attributes of Chris Summers, evident in his career progression and achievements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ICE HOCKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ice hockey is the sport in which Chris Summers excelled and played professionally."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASKETBALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Basketball is the sport in which Chris Summers was drafted by the Cleveland Cavaliers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DRAFT SELECTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Draft selection is a significant milestone in a player's career, as exemplified by Chris Summers' selections by the Arizona Coyotes and the Cleveland Cavaliers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIVOTAL MOMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pivotal moments in Chris Summers' career include his draft selections and his performances with various teams."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATHLETICISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Athleticism is a key skill that Chris Summers possesses, as evidenced by his performance in both ice hockey and basketball."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WINNING MENTALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A winning mentality is a characteristic that Chris Summers brings to his teams, as highlighted by his performance and dedication."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WINNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Winning is a goal that Chris Summers aims for in both his ice hockey and basketball careers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHALLENGING TRANSITION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The transition from ice hockey to basketball presents a challenging but exciting opportunity for Chris Summers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JACKSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jackson is quoted discussing the transition from hockey to the NBA, expressing concerns about the riskiness of the move."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUMMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Summers is the individual making the transition from hockey to the NBA, remaining optimistic about his chances despite criticism."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAVALIERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cavaliers are the NBA team that Summers is joining, facing criticism for his transition from hockey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NBA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NBA is the professional basketball league where Summers is transitioning to, described as a different game with different skills and strategies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HOCKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hockey is the sport Summers is coming from, implying a different athletic background compared to basketball."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAVS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cavs is a nickname for the Cavaliers, the NBA team Summers is joining, facing criticism for his transition."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATHLETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Athletic refers to the physical fitness and skills required in sports, mentioned in relation to Summers' transition."</data>
